  "solution": {
    "text": "Given planes are:<br /><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ...(i)<br /><br /><math><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ...(ii)<br /><br /><math><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ...(iii)<br /><br />Equation of the plane passing through the line of intersection of the plane (i) and (ii) may be taken as:<br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ...(iv)<br /><br />If plane (iii) and (iv) are the same, then&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>or</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math><br /><br />and <math><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
